# Schema people

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Person {
        id UUID
        age Integer
        email String
    }
```

## Types

### Person

Person is a registered individual.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary |  |
| `age` | `Integer[0, 150]` |  |  |
| `email` | `String` |  |  |

**Invariants**

- "adults only"

  ```yammm
  ! "adults only" age >= 18
  ```

- "age within bounds"

  Snapshot bound, revisit at next census.

  ```yammm
  ! "age within bounds" age >= 0 &&
  age <= 150
  ```
